K2Lang_Offer_Text:
TSLRCM is available in your language as an official Steam Workshop edition, and that is the version you want: the English edition would replace your game's text with English.

Install the {0} edition now?

Steam will open the Workshop page — press Subscribe there. The installer then waits for the download (about 335 MB), copies the files into your game, and tells you when to unsubscribe again. {1}

K2Tslrcm_WizardIntro_Format:
The download finished and was verified.

{0}

The TSLRCM setup wizard opens next. Note: the wizard is in English. Make sure its install folder points at your KOTOR 2 folder shown above, NOT at the Override subfolder. When the wizard finishes, this installer continues.

